# Combat for everyone else (zero-vtes rules-qa 98.1, 98.2, checked at 1f33be5): each combat step
# polls every Methuselah, the acting minion's first, then the opposing one's, then the others
# clockwise from the acting one, for cards that reach a combat they're not in (Rötschreck,
# Abjure). They pass automatically unless they hold the step, and can't maneuver or strike.
# Alice plays first; Bob blocks her hunt; Carol and Dave are outside the combat.
seed 27
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
seat D dave
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
library A "Iron Ward" *40
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
library B "Quick Feed" *40
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *12
library C "Signal Fire" *40
crypt D "Odile Fen" *12
library D "Iron Ward" *40
start

A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> transfer +4 A:ready:1
B> transfer +4 B:ready:1
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion

A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
D> pass
expect action hunt A combat
expect combat 1 before-range close

# Before range, Carol asks the table to wait: after Alice and Bob pass, the impulse comes to her.
C> hold
A> pass
B> pass
expect impulse C
expect waiting C:impulse
reject:forbidden C> maneuver long
reject:forbidden C> strike hand
# She plays a card that reaches the combat; the impulse returns to Alice, the passes start over.
C> play C:hand:1
log public Round 1 · Before range: C played Signal Fire
expect impulse A
A> pass
B> pass
expect impulse C
C> pass
# Dave passed automatically; the step is over, and Carol's hold with it.
expect combat 1 range close
A> pass
B> pass
expect combat 1 before-strikes close
